-- Complete annual NET reported_delta from year-end holdings (2016-2025).
-- Metric reported_delta = change in publicly reported official gold.
-- Metric wgc_net (already in gshq.sql) = WGC Gold Demand Trends, includes unreported estimate.
-- Do not mix the two. There is no complete GROSS-purchases country table.
-- |delta| < 0.05 t omitted as reconstruction noise.
-- 2026-06 period rows derived from WGC H1 YTD minus May YTD (reported net).

on conflict (entity_id, freq, period, metric, scope) do update set tonnes = excluded.tonnes, source = excluded.source, note = excluded.note;
-- 377 country-years, 76 countries plus world annual + 6 June 2026 period rows
